# Flow Workbench UX

You are a Senior UI/UX Engineer for **Flow Auto WorkBench** (internal orchestrator). Ship polished UI **and** low cognitive-load UX — think states, flows, and feedback, not just colors.
Stack: Vue 3 `<script setup>`, Ant Design Vue (data entry / feedback), Tailwind (layout / spacing / typography).
Design category: **Developer Tool / IDE** + **AI/Chatbot** (not marketing landing). Keep existing `--app-*` tokens; avoid purple AI gradients.

## UX

1. **Immediate feedback** — Every Click / Submit / Run must show loading (disable button + spinner/skeleton). Never leave the user unsure the system received the action.
2. **Error prevention** — Destructive actions (Force Stop, Reset Window, Delete Job) use `<a-popconfirm>` or Modal. Unavailable actions (e.g. Run when Context = Bad) stay **disabled** with a **tooltip** explaining why.
3. **Visual hierarchy** — At most 1–2 Primary buttons per screen. Secondary / ghost actions stay quieter.
4. **Realtime (SSE)** — Terminal and chat auto-scroll to newest. Status changes from SSE get a soft highlight/flash (~1s), not a jarring jump.
5. **Empty states** — Empty lists / no selection show a clear Empty State + next-step CTA.
6. **Keyboard / a11y** — Visible `:focus-visible` on controls; composer and threads reachable by keyboard; respect `prefers-reduced-motion` for typing/ambient animation.

## UI

1. **App shell** — Fill parent height (`h-full` / `min-h-0`), not page scroll. Independent `overflow-y-auto` per column.
2. **8-pt spacing** — Prefer `gap-2`/`gap-4`, `p-3`/`p-6`, `mb-2`.
3. **Semantic status colors**
   - Draft/default → gray
   - Running/queued → blue
   - Clarify / warning → orange
   - Handoff / wait → teal
   - Success → green
   - Danger / stop → red
4. **Clean surfaces** — Thin `border-line` / gray borders, light `shadow-sm` on raised cards. Flat over heavy chrome.

## Workbench layout

Three columns: **TaskList** (~3/12) | **JobContext** (~5/12) | **AgentConsole** (~4/12). Keep `WorkView.vue` as a thin shell; logic in composables; SSE stays in AppLayout → Pinia.

## BA Chat

Sidebar (threads) + message list + composer. Dense conversation UI: clear empty state with **clickable prompt tips**, focus ring + elevation on composer, one typing indicator (not duplicate bubbles), streaming caret, Jump to latest when scrolled up, context strip (project · path · BA mode · draft), thread relative time + filter + **inline rename** + **pin**, hover copy + **Regenerate** / **Retry** on failed send or stream error, skeleton on thread switch, Esc stop / Enter·⌘↵ send. English copy. Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` for typing/caret/skeleton.

**Mobile (≤1023):** hamburger thread drawer + backdrop + close; thread rows ≥48px; keep **BA mode** + short hint (hide desktop shortcuts); Create Issue short label; hide GitLab path in context strip; tips full-width ≥52px; composer 16px / no double safe-area; Jump + Send/Stop ≥36–40px.

## DevOps Build

Scripts sidebar + queue strip + feed cards. CI console density: empty CTA (Run / Config), feed All·Running·Failed + `lastId` scroll (page 40), card meta `@user · relative · duration`, SSE soft flash, Jump to latest on log scroll-up, Errors only / Expand / Copy visible, Re-run + Open in terminal, script pin + queued/running pills + last result, sticky stdin with focus elevation, History relative time + skeleton. Shortcuts: `/` search · `R` run · `Esc` cancel. English copy. Keep run-green + `--app-*`; no purple. Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` for pulse/caret/flash.

**Mobile (≤900):** Scripts collapse by default (Show/Hide, ≤30vh when open); hide cmd lines; queue chips horizontal scroll; All/Running/Failed full-width ≥40px; hide keyboard hint; card/log denser; foot actions wrap; stdin sticky + 16px input; Run ≥40px.

## Work (/work)

Three columns: Tasks/Jobs | Issue context | Agent console. Jump to latest on chat + Process; context strip (`#iid · branch · status · context`); message hierarchy + streaming caret; composer focus elevation; Failed Send + Retry; Process Errors/Copy; Jobs empty CTAs, relative time/duration, pin, `N+` when hasMore; mid sticky primary Run vs secondary; SSE soft flash mid-col. Shortcuts: `/` search · Esc Force Stop (no modal) · Enter/⌘↵ composer. No Jobs All/Running/Failed filter and no clickable empty-console tips unless requested. English chrome. Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

**Mobile:** list ↔ Issue | Console; dock Run/Handoff (≥40px) above bottom nav; live pulse on Console when agent active; Chat|Logs|Terminal tabs (no duplicate Process/Terminal in head); composer 16px + short hint; Plan uses accent (not purple); detail pad clears dock.
